#13200
The Astral Plane Extensions~
This is a very handy area for linking alternate planes to, particularly
if the areas are intended to be very difficult, as the Astral plane is
itself difficult to reach. The color pools provide the neccessary means
to form links to alternate areas.
Vex October, 1997
ps. I believe this area was originally done by Andi?
~
132 512 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#13201
The Astral Plane~
   The space here is composed of a bright, well-lit grayness that
extends in all directions, resembling a thick silver atmosphere. 
The astral material is very clear, and vision is unimpaired to its
physical limits.  There is no gravity here, and small bits of
debris float endlessly in some random direction without end.   
~
