#13206
Edge of a Sphere of Fire~
   The astral plane here is much hotter than the surrounding 
areas.  There is a large sphere of fire, resembling a huge 
fireball floating in space here.  The flames don't seem to 
be coming from anything in particular, but more resemble a 
small chunk of the Elemental Plane of Fire itself, that 
somehow found it's way here.   
~
