#13221
Great Worm Hole~
   The plane shifts and twists here into a massive funnel, rising
out of nowhere and dissapearing into a cloud of mist.  Gravity is
a bit thicker around the neck of worm hole, drawing objects towards
it.  The cone is several miles in diameter, thinning out to a few
feet at its end.  It is rumored that such wormholes connect every
plane of existence to the Astral plane.
~
