#13233
Yggdrasil, the World Ash~
   A mammoth oak tree rises out of a cloud of mist here, and 
extends far beyond the range of sight.  The tree itself is 
about two-hundred feet around, with great thick branches 
that also disappear far off into the distance.  Yggdrasil 
emanates an aura of great power, and glows faintly blue.  It 
is rumored that this mighty tree touches every known plane 
of existence, and is used by the gods themselves to travel 
from one plane to another. 
~
