Yggdrasil yggdrasil tree~
Upon closer examination, you get the feeling that this tree 
has a vast intelligence of it's own.  Its consciousness 
touches you, and a feeling of incredible peace and bliss 
flows into your soul. Even though only the gods are powerful 
enough to use this tree as a method of transport, you know it 
to be a great landmark on the astral plane.
~
