#13326
An Astral rift in space~
   The fabric of the plane here shifts and moves about in a
dizzying pattern.  Directly above there is a large circular gate,
black in color and covered with glowing runes.  There is a rather
odd looking keyhole in the gate.  Because everything is shifting so
fast, no way can be seen to bypass the gate except to the South,
where things look more clam.  There appears to something written on
the gate. 
~
132 5 0 0 0 2 255 0
D0
The astral plane continues.
~
~
0 0 13255
D4
A huge black gate is there.
~
gate black~
2 13370 13327
E
gate circular large~
From the looks of this glowing keyhole, a thief has no chance in
hell of picking it.  The inscriptions on it are very old and can
barely be made out to read :

      Do not come here if you value your pathetic life...         
                  Kalnarish of the Githyanki
~
S
#13327
Astral Sanctuary~
   This appears to be some sort of holdover for astral travelers.
The gate cannot be seen from here, though it is probably still there.
The astral space here spins around at lightning speed, probably the
work of some powerful spell, with multi-colored lights swirling and
dancing about.  There is a huge statue floating here, above a rather
large fountain.  An aura of peace and calm penetrates this area.

~
132 393244 0 0 0 0 255 0
D5
You see an astral rift there!
~
gate black~
2 13370 13326
E
statue~
The statue is of a female warrior, dressed in golden plate mail
armor and brandishing what looks like a powerful golden long sword. 
She has long black hair that reaches down her back, and deep brown
eyes.  As you look, her image seems to shift in and out transforming
from an asian princess into a golden female dragon, and back again.
