Several small orbs of red glowing light are embedded into the
ceiling high above, illuminating the area with a dull red hue.  On
the eastern and western walls, huge stunning murals depict Takhisis,
the mighty Chromatic Dragon in flight, with her five heads each
blasting their deadly breath into the sky.  On the northern wall,
a great golden tablet rests on top of a fat marble pedestal.  The
tablet is covered with writing.  The only exit is back to the
south. 
~
