tablet golden~

The tablet is ancient looking, with many lines of text carved into it;
.                                                                           . 
.                       Takhisis.  Queen of Darkness...                     .
.                                                                           .
.      Takhisis is the most powerful of all evil dragons, and rules from    .
.        her castle here on Avernus.  The breath of her five heads is       .
.      formidable indeed, and it is rumored that few mortals have ever      .
.     survived its awesome might.  Sages have speculated that Takhisis was  . 
.    born many thousands of years ago in a war between evil dragons, and    .
.   that the gods threw the combatants together, forming a single entity.   . 
.      Since then, the evil dragons no longer fight amongst themselves.     . 
.      She is always accompanied by her court of male great wyrms, who      .
.    would all die to defend her.  She always remains knowledgeable about   .
.   what is transpiring on other worlds and plains, and on occasion takes   .
.  the form of lesser beings to spread her evil bane.  The treasure beneath .
.  her layer is said to be enormous, though few have been known to survive  .
.    long enough to see it.  The entrance to her layer is protected by a    . 
.   sentient magical vault, and will only open for those worthy enough to   .
.       face her, only for those who can solve it's magical riddle..        .
.It is known to the sages on Krynn, that this, their evil Queen of Darkness,.
.   bears the name true evil in their world, for on Krynn, she is darkness  .
.                                                                           . 
.                           So speaks the Oracle of Knowledge.              . 
