    You proceed past the star-shaped chamber, its power broken
and follow the narrowing walls to this darkened corridor. You
now notice the runes adorning the obsidian rock pulsate softly,
as if they grow in power towards something. You stare blankly
upward and gaze at a reddish haze filled sky, swirling and shifting
with noxious vapors and gasses. The humidity near makes you faint.
~
