A twisted jungle~
   The black walls lead into this thick jungle of brown and
green foliage so dense you require your swords to chop your
way through it. The humidity is near unbearable, and has made
you sweat so intensely, your mouth is dry for lack of water.
Lizards, serpents, and other reptilian creatures you can not
identify slither and crawl through the dank vegetation. A
sense of impending doom pulsates from the south.
~
