The demonic spires~
   You stumble choking out of the thick putrid foliage into this
grand clearing. Once again the black, rune covered walls emerge
and extend into a massive stone spire, strethcing into the heavens.
A large set of carved double doors, some fifty feet high are set
into the face of the spire. Only the strongest of hearts or
darkest of souls dare proceed through these doors, that much
is clear to you. You think you hear a great hiss and roar from
beyond and near soil yourself and flee.
~
