   You have entered the domain of Demogorgon, said to be perhaps the
greatest Demon Lord of them All. Before you stand cold black spires of
rock, stretching up to a reddish hazed sky. These spires form a huge
circle of power, where the Demon deals and plots his macabre schemes.
The centre of this circle is occupied by a pool made of white stone.
You choke in agony on the fumes of his fetid breath, which permeates
every corner of this chamber. You have come to die it seems.
~
