#13454
The chamber of hate~
   Upon moving into this room, your senses are assaulted by a 
force of sheer hatred so powerful, you must stagger to remain
standing. The blackened walls of the opening are covered with
a massive relief of two demon lords and thier minions facing
one another. One Demon is grossly fat, with the head of a ram and
legs of a goat. He wields a large skull tipped wand, and is
surrounded by legions of ghouls, zombies, skeletons, and ghasts.
You know this being as Orcus, Prince of the Undead. The other
larger figure is reptilian, with 2 massive tentacles for arms, and
two mandrill heads. He glares at Orcus in demonic fury.
~
